{{Short description|Football tournament group stage}}
{{Use dmy dates|date=May 2018}}
'''Group 4 of the [[1974 FIFA World Cup]]''' was contested  between 15 and 23 June 1974.  This group is played on two sites: [[Munich]] and [[Stuttgart]].<ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.rsssf.org/tables/74full.html |title=World Cup 1974 finals |publisher=[[RSSSF]] |access-date=30 April 2026}}</ref>

The pool is seeded by [[Italy national football team|Italy]] (''Pot 1-Western Europe'') accompanied by [[Poland national football team|Poland]] (''Pot 2-Eastern Europe''), [[Argentina national football team|Argentina]] (''Pot 3-South America''), and [[Haiti national football team|Haiti]] (''Pot 4-Rest of the world'').

